Growing up, I watched my father dance to Ishq Tera Tadpave with such joy that it was infectious. I started mimicking his moves, and it soon became our song. It also became the song I could dance to without worrying about how I look or if people were looking at me funny. Inadvertently our dance routine helped my self-esteem/image.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
